.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.PP
.nf
Setting self\&.requests = [somerequest] prevents more requests from being
received until the out buffers have been flushed\&.

Setting self\&.requests = [] allows more requests to be received\&.

.fi
.PP
 
